<h2 id="corrections">Corrections</h2>

<h3 id="report-an-error">Report an error</h3>
{% if site.correctionUrl %}
<p>If you think a figure or a statement is wrong, <a href="{{ site.correctionUrl }}">tell us which one and what you think it should be</a>.</p>
{%- if site.correctionUrl.startsWith("https://github.com/") %}
<p>The link opens this site's issues on GitHub, the website that holds its source files. Choose New issue to send a report. It is the only way to report an error: there is no email address. You need a GitHub account to send a report. It is free, but it is still a barrier, and it is a known limit of this site.</p>
{%- endif %}
{% else %}
{% call m.unavailable("a way to report an error", 4) %}
<p>The route for reporting an error has not been set up. It is set when the site is published. The site will not be published without it.</p>
{% endcall %}
{% endif %}

<h3 id="how-corrections-are-handled">How corrections are handled</h3>
<ol>
  <li>We make a correction first if it changes what a reader would conclude.</li>
  <li>We correct the figure or statement in the central register, so every page that uses it changes together.</li>
  <li>We list the correction here with its date and a plain explanation.</li>
  <li>If a claim can no longer be supported and cannot be corrected at once, we remove it or mark it as withdrawn.</li>
</ol>

<h3 id="log">Log</h3>
<p>The log keeps three kinds of change apart.</p>
<dl>
  <dt>Errors made by this site</dt>
  <dd>{% if corrections.errors | length %}<ul>{% for item in corrections.errors %}<li>{{ item.date | timeTag | safe }}: {{ item.text }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>{% else %}None recorded.{% if not site.production %} The site has not been published.{% endif %}{% endif %}</dd>
  <dt>Changes in policy or rates</dt>
  <dd>{% if corrections.policy_changes | length %}<ul>{% for item in corrections.policy_changes %}<li>{{ item.date | timeTag | safe }}: {{ item.text }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>{% else %}None recorded.{% endif %}</dd>
  <dt>Revisions by the producer of a statistic</dt>
  <dd>{% if corrections.statistical_revisions | length %}<ul>{% for item in corrections.statistical_revisions %}<li>{{ item.date | timeTag | safe }}: {{ item.text }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>{% else %}None recorded.{% endif %}</dd>
</dl>

