<h2 id="figure-register">Register of figures</h2>
<p>The figures used in the text of the pages, {{ figures | length }} in all. The year-by-year history, the detailed tables, the example budgets and the calculator's scenarios are kept in their own records, and each shows its source where it is used.</p>
<details class="more">
  <summary>Show the register of figures</summary>
  {% call m.scrollTable() %}
  <table>
    <caption id="table-register-figures">Register of figures</caption>
    <thead><tr><th scope="col">Figure</th><th scope="col" class="num">Value</th><th scope="col">Period</th><th scope="col">Kind</th><th scope="col">First caveat</th><th scope="col">Where</th><th scope="col">Source</th><th scope="col">Checked</th></tr></thead>
